<time>2026-05-28T08:26:09Z</time>
<name>Selsey Bridge Halt</name>
<desc><![CDATA[You are now at Selsey Bridge Halt.  This was the original terminus of the line because Selsey Town station had not yet been completed. 
It featured the only over bridge crossing the line, carrying the main Selsey road. The bridge has since been filled in but the cutting on the other side of the road can still be seen.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
</rtept>
