<rtept lat="50.7358400000" lon="-0.7832000000">
<time>2026-05-28T08:26:09Z</time>
<name>Selsey Town Station</name>
<desc><![CDATA[The station building was in the middle of what is now Manor Road. The houses to the right and along Allandale Close are on the rest of the site. 
It was expected that the line would bring coal and other goods to Selsey and take fish and seafood away but in fact, the fish trade was small. Journey times from here to Chichester were published as 30 minutes but tended to take much longer.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
