<rtept lat="50.7335800000" lon="-0.7749400000">
<time>2026-05-28T08:26:09Z</time>
<name>Selsey Beach Station</name>
<desc>The line was extended to Beach station in 1898 with a view to carrying tourists to East Beach and taking the products of the local fishing fleet to Chichester and London. The train on the right is leaving Selsey Town for Beach. The station was not a success and closed before the First World War.</desc>
